          <h3 class="text-body-sm-strong text-ink m-0 mb-1">How fast does changing a paddle relieve tennis elbow?</h3>
          <p class="text-body-sm text-body m-0">
            Switching to a 16mm/20mm core paddle reduces immediate shock recoil on day one. Full tendon recovery usually requires 3–6 weeks of rest and physical therapy.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-body-sm-strong text-ink m-0 mb-1">Should I stop playing completely if I have arm pain?</h3>
          <p class="text-body-sm text-body m-0">
            If you experience sharp joint pain during rallies, stop playing immediately and consult a physical therapist. Equipment adjustments assist comfort but do not replace medical care.
          </p>
